# Rebuildable tool products stay out of the published project.
**/xsim.dir/
**/.Xil/
**/.sim/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.wdb
**/*.pb
**/*.jou
**/*.dcp
**/ip_work/
**/*.log
!reports/**/*.log
/.ppt_build_gcore/
/Pcore/output/
/output/*
